        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Brophy Estates are delighted to bring to the market 2 Ashton Rise This is a 2-bedroom apartment with own door for access. The spacious accommodation comprises of a hallway which leads to a bright large living area with access to a sunny west facing balcony. Off the living room you are led the kitchen then on to the bedroom, bathroom which leads the master bedroom with ensuite. ashton Broc is ideally located in the heart of Applewood Village and a short drive from the town centre of Swords which offers a full range of local amenities including schools, shops, restaurants, cafes and excellent public transport links including the Swords Express offering direct access to the city centre. Dublin International Airport, M50/M1 motorways are all within easy access of the property"
